Typical MCP configuration for Claude Code (generated by `km connect claude-code`):

{
  "mcpServers": {
    "knowledge-manager": {
      "command": "km",
      "args": ["--kb-path", "/path/to/kb", "serve"],
      "env": {}
    }
  }
}

The agent host runs `km --kb-path /path/to/kb serve`, which starts create_server() and enters the MCP stdio loop.
